// an Assign attachment and nothing else. It must carry an identifier, and it
// must not carry a URL: a signed download URL is minted per request after a
// fresh authorization check (ADR 0028) and must never come to rest in stored
// content, and an image that could name an external host would let a stored
// document make a reader's browser contact a third party.
